# Git-ignored files Claude Code copies into every worktree it creates
# (https://code.claude.com/docs/en/worktrees#copy-gitignored-files-into-worktrees).
# Without vendor/moonshine/wasm, `pnpm typecheck` fails on `moonshine-wasm`.
# The models and test assets (`pnpm fetch:dictation --test-assets`, ~1.5 GB)
# stay out; fetch them in the worktree when a test needs them.
vendor/moonshine/wasm/**
vendor/moonshine/linux-x86_64/**
